<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Asal muasal maskapé iki awalé saka masa pertama &lt;a href="penerbangan"&gt;penerbangan&lt;/a&gt; lan masa-masa sawisé &lt;a href="Perang%20Dunia%20I"&gt;Perang Dunia I&lt;/a&gt;. Salah siji perusahaan awal British Airways, Aircraft Transport and Travel (AT&amp;T), ngluncuraké penerbangan internasional berjadwal pertama ing dunya nalika &lt;a href="25%20Agustus"&gt;25 Agustus&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1919"&gt;1919&lt;/a&gt; antarané &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika &lt;a href="31%20Maret"&gt;31 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1924"&gt;1924&lt;/a&gt;, papat maskapé Britania-Instone, Handley Page, Daimler Airways (penerus AT&amp;T), sarta British Air Marine Navigation-gabung dadi &lt;a href="Imperial%20Airways"&gt;Imperial Airways&lt;/a&gt; kang nglayani rute marang &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Afrika"&gt;Afrika&lt;/a&gt;.
Nalika waktu kang pada, pira-pira maskapé cilik liyané uga gabung nalika &lt;a href="1935"&gt;1935&lt;/a&gt; mbentuk salah sijiné maskapé swasta kanti jeneng &lt;a href="British%20Airways%20Ltd."&gt;British Airways Ltd.&lt;/a&gt; Déning pamaréntah, Imperial Airways lan British Airways dinasionalisasi nalika &lt;a href="1939"&gt;1939&lt;/a&gt; mbentuk &lt;a href="British%20Overseas%20Airways%20Corporation"&gt;British Overseas Airways Corporation&lt;/a&gt; (BOAC). Rute-rute marang &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Selatan"&gt;Amérika Selatan&lt;/a&gt; dilakokaké déning &lt;a href="British%20South%20American%20Airways"&gt;British South American Airways&lt;/a&gt; (kang sabanjuré gabung marang BOAC nalika &lt;a href="1949"&gt;1949&lt;/a&gt;) lan penerbangan domestik sarta marang &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt; dilakokaké &lt;a href="British%20European%20Airways"&gt;British European Airways&lt;/a&gt; (BEA), sakliya rute-rute mau, sekabèhané dilakokaké déning BOAC.
nalika &lt;a href="1950-an"&gt;1950-an&lt;/a&gt;, penggunaan pesawat kanti mesin jet ing dunya dimulai déning BOAC kanti &lt;a href="De%20Havilland%20Comet"&gt;De Havilland Comet&lt;/a&gt; marang &lt;a href="Johannesburg"&gt;Johannesburg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Afrika%20Selatan"&gt;Afrika Selatan&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="1952"&gt;1952&lt;/a&gt;. Kanggo méloni arus wektu iku, BEA ngedegaké BEA Airtours kang wiwit nalika &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika &lt;a href="1972"&gt;1972&lt;/a&gt;, BOAC lan BEA digabungaké sajeroning British Airways Board lan mabur kanti jeneng British Airways nalika &lt;a href="1974"&gt;1974&lt;/a&gt;.
British Airways lan &lt;a href="Air%20France"&gt;Air France&lt;/a&gt; ngluncuraké layanan pesawat supersonik &lt;a href="Concorde"&gt;Concorde&lt;/a&gt; nalika Januari &lt;a href="1976"&gt;1976&lt;/a&gt;.
