Polifenol

Polifenol (poliphenol) ya iku golongan bahan &lt;a href="kimia"&gt;kimia&lt;/a&gt; kng ndarbèni punjul siji unit &lt;a href="fenol"&gt;fenol&lt;/a&gt; saben &lt;a href="molekul"&gt;molekul&lt;/a&gt;. Polifenol tinemu kanthi alami ing &lt;a href="tetuwuhan"&gt;tetuwuhan&lt;/a&gt;. Polifenol migunani kanggo mènèhi warna ing tetuwuhan, tuladhané warna &lt;a href="godhong"&gt;godhong&lt;/a&gt; nalika alum utawa arep gogrog. Polifenol alami uga ngayomi tuwuhan nglawan &lt;a href="patogen"&gt;patogen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="parasit"&gt;parasit&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="predator"&gt;predator&lt;/a&gt;. Jinis polifenol kang paling asring tinemu ing tetuwuhan ya iku &lt;a href="flavonoid"&gt;flavonoid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="asem%20fenolat"&gt;asem fenolat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="catechin"&gt;catechin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="anthocyanin"&gt;anthocyanin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="isoflavin"&gt;isoflavin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="quercetin"&gt;quercetin&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="resveratrol"&gt;resveratrol&lt;/a&gt;. Wis akèh penelitiyan kang njlèntrèhaké yèn polifenol ndarbèni mupangat kanggo awak &lt;a href="manungsa"&gt;manungsa&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sumber Polifenol</h2>
Sumber Polifenol.
Woh-wohan, jejanganan, lan &lt;a href="teh"&gt;teh&lt;/a&gt; kalebu panganan kang ngandhut akèh polifenol. &lt;a href="Stroberi"&gt;Stroberi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="blackberry"&gt;blackberry&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="apel"&gt;apel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="delima"&gt;delima&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="anggur"&gt;anggur&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pir"&gt;pir&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="plum"&gt;plum&lt;/a&gt; kalebu woh-wohan kang ngandhut polifenol kang dhuwur. Déné jejanganan kang ngandhut polifenol ya iku &lt;a href="kubis"&gt;kubis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="brokoli"&gt;brokoli&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="bawang"&gt;bawang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="peterseli"&gt;peterseli&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="seledri"&gt;seledri&lt;/a&gt;. Kajaba iku, polifenol bisa tinemu ing &lt;a href="anggur%20abang"&gt;anggur abang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kopi"&gt;kopi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="teh"&gt;teh&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="coklat"&gt;coklat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="lenga%20zaitun"&gt;lenga zaitun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kacang-kacangan"&gt;kacang-kacangan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="kenari"&gt;kenari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="mete"&gt;mete&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="hezelnut"&gt;hezelnut&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="pecan"&gt;pecan&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="kacang%20brol"&gt;kacang brol&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Mupangat</h2>
Mupangat.
Sawatara polifenol nduwé mupangat wigati banget, kaya ta &lt;a href="flavon"&gt;flavon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="flavonoid"&gt;flavonoid&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="isoflavon"&gt;isoflavon&lt;/a&gt; kang dimagertèni duwé sipat &lt;a href="antioksidan"&gt;antioksidan&lt;/a&gt;. Antioksidan iki dipracaya nduwé khasiat ngundhakaké kemampuan &lt;a href="anti-inflamasi"&gt;anti-inflamasi&lt;/a&gt; lan kanggo kekebalan awak. Kandhutan &lt;a href="antioksidan"&gt;antioksidan&lt;/a&gt; ing polifenol bisa netralaké radhikal bébas kang nduwé èfèk ngrusak sèl-sèl lan jaringan awak lan uga bisa ngalang-ngalangi prosès dadi tuwa amarga radhikal bébas mau. Polifenol uga nguwataké sistem kekebalan awak kanggo njaga kasarasan lan nyegah tuwuhé &lt;a href="lelara"&gt;lelara&lt;/a&gt;.
